		{"id":"a5cf30e588de62bb","type":"text","text":"La demande de marché est la somme de la demmande individuel $$ D(p) = \\sum_{i=1}^{N} d_i(p)\n$$\nla **demande individuelle** : di(p)d_i(p)di​(p)","x":-2111,"y":524,"width":489,"height":166},
